cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: ojs-codecheck
abstract: >-
  An Open Journal Systems (OJS) plugin that integrates the CODECHECK process
  into a journal's submission, editorial and publication workflows: codecheck
  metadata and status on the submission, a generated codecheck.yml, deposit to
  the CODECHECK Register, and display of CODECHECK certificates to readers.
